From 6550ddc862514f88fe7139b0b386887eb33fb442 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeffy Chen <jeffy.chen@rock-chips.com>
Date: Mon, 25 Dec 2023 16:58:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 97/98] vnc: Improve GL renderer performance with GBM backend

Major changes:
1/ Replace FBO with GBM for GL renderer to reduce overhead
2/ Support configurable buffer count for VNC output via env
"WESTON_VNC_MIN_BUFFERS"

Tested on RK3588 EVB:
1/ Run `weston -B vnc` or `weston -B drm,vnc`
2/ Launch vncviewer on a remote PC
3/ Execute `weston-simple-egl -f` to verify fullscreen EGL rendering

Signed-off-by: Jeffy Chen <jeffy.chen@rock-chips.com>
